# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-16, 2.1-F3). E §6.3 balance: "At a place that keeps parts (tally 2.1), a reading that states
# parts also shows each stated part's gap, of <q>, and the unstated rest's, rest, each stated - booked, in the order of
# the reading's rows (LANGUAGE §5.19)". Layout (refcore's): after the total's `booked, stated, gap`, each `; of <q>:` and
# `; rest:` with the same three. ania's 100.00 and tomek's 50.00 are booked; the anchor states 150.00, ania's 90.00:
# ania's gap -10.00, the rest stated 60.00 over 50.00 booked, gap 10.00 (scratch/expf.py).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind couples: parties
kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w order if k.owner == ania then 0 else 1
kind tomeks: transfers
place konto: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input a1_day: date
input a1_amt: money PLN
input t1_day: date
input t1_amt: money PLN
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule base = if p == ania then 1 else 0
  rule t beats base = if p == tomek then 1 else 0 when m in tomeks
move a1: transfers
  on a1_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1_amt
move t1: tomeks
  on t1_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount t1_amt
ask r: residuals konto 2026-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2010-06-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  a1_day = 2026-02-01
  a1_amt = 100.00 PLN
  t1_day = 2026-02-02
  t1_amt = 50.00 PLN

version stmt
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-01
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 150.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end
  stated[konto] of ania = 90.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end
=== expect
r: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 balance: model 150.00 PLN, observed 150.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    balance konto 2026-03-31 end (anchored): booked 150.00 PLN, stated 150.00 PLN, gap 0.00 PLN; of ania: booked 100.00 PLN, stated 90.00 PLN, gap -10.00 PLN; rest: booked 50.00 PLN, stated 60.00 PLN, gap 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-01
